WEBVTT

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:15.920
Hey, now, that was cruel.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:18.870
You and I had so many 
memories with that bike.

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:21.910
Remember? You'd sit behind me and—

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:24.960
Hey, no need to rush.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:27.070
The night is still young.

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:28.750
Let's take our time...

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.170
Like we did that one day.

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:35.630
You perverted son of a bitch!

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:54.060
What was that just now?

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:56.440
Man, what a waste.

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:00.700
And here I was trying to make things 
like they were when we first met.

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:07.000
Don't show me stupid crap like that!

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:15.760
<b><i>Bubuki/Buranki</i></b>

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:15.800
<b><i>Bubuki/Buranki</i></b>

